DCE helper functions return `Vec<CfgValue>`, allocating on every call:

```rust
// crates/rue-cfg/src/dce.rs
fn terminator_uses(term: &Terminator) -> Vec<CfgValue> {
    match term {
        Terminator::Goto { args, .. } => args.clone(),  // Clones entire Vec
