These are called for every instruction during liveness analysis.

## Proposed Solution

Use an iterator or callback pattern:

```rust
// Option 1: Iterator
fn terminator_uses(term: &Terminator) -> impl Iterator<Item = CfgValue> + '_ {
    match term {
        Terminator::Goto { args, .. } => args.iter().copied(),
        // ...
    }
}

// Option 2: Callback/visitor
fn visit_terminator_uses(term: &Terminator, mut f: impl FnMut(CfgValue)) {
    match term {
        Terminator::Goto { args, .. } => args.iter().for_each(|&v| f(v)),
        // ...
    }
}
```

