### Phase 4: Handle invalid immediates

When an immediate can't be encoded, fallback to materializing it:

```rust
fn emit_logical_op(&mut self, op: LogicalOp, dst: Reg, src: Reg, imm: u64) {
    if let Some((n, immr, imms)) = encode_logical_immediate(imm) {
        // Direct encoding
        self.emit_logical_imm(op, dst, src, n, immr, imms);
    } else {
        // Fallback: materialize constant in scratch register
        let scratch = self.allocate_scratch();
        self.materialize_constant(scratch, imm);
        self.emit_logical_reg(op, dst, src, scratch);
    }
}
```

